// Demonstrates: a node may have at most one auto-forward reply (a reply with no statement, i.e.
// "[[NodeName]]" with no leading text). A second one is an error. Followed by a third error (a
// command, itself in "after reply" position), to prove resync here doesn't over- or under-consume.
title: Start
speaker: Narrator
---
[[Start]]
[[Start]]
<<sett $x = 1>>
